mathacademy/question-capture/13934292/assets/7785ad73f6e5212772c3053780ffd055f37cfb39927b6ddc3e40cd3a55b8ba4e.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false. The vertical asymptotes of the function are integer multiples of $\\pi $, i.e., $x=n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement II is false. The domain of the function is all real numbers except the values where the asymptotes occur, i.e., $x=n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement III is true. The period of $y=cot⁡x$ is $\\pi .$" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247301 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247302 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247303 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247304 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247305 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1041 "selection" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247303 13194139533693 true] [17592186247300 1110 #uuid "4dbd4702-9535-5dbf-a2d8-d24331024d34" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247301 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247301 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533693 true] [17592186247301 1111 #uuid "42852455-1abd-5fae-bf27-b7522a46d316" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247302 1034 "I only" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247302 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533693 true] [17592186247302 1111 #uuid "99668bc9-84f4-519d-a307-6e4280b55e14" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247303 1034 "III only" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247303 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533693 true] [17592186247303 1111 #uuid "4f43a53f-0d0c-5877-88b2-ebe4caee3b06" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247304 1034 "I and II only" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247304 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533693 true] [17592186247304 1111 #uuid "10486fac-99c3-56f9-964d-483dbf01b69c" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247305 1034 "II only" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247