ate the graph ${180}^{∘}$ around the origin, we get the same picture. This means that $cot⁡x$ is an *odd* function, and we have\n\n$$\ncot⁡(-x)=-cot⁡x.\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}cot⁡(-x) & =-cot⁡x \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247343 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247344 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247345 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247346 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247347 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1041 "selection" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247344 13194139533693 true] [17592186247342 1110 #uuid "dc21ffd8-dc80-5967-870f-d35d16117a7e" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247343 1034 "-\\frac{2}{5}" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247343 1111 #uuid "5b27ea71-5ce6-53ed-91b6-4f1be8956513" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247344 1034 "-\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247344 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247344 1111 #uuid "f529e2d4-ffe5-53f5-bcd9-6fea86ccbd60" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247345 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247345 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247345 1111 #uuid "fafad114-c4f2-579f-989b-84fdffc9def9" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247346 1034 "\\frac{2}{5}" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247346 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247346 1111 #uuid "2284a17f-ff98-552a-9f2d-64a4ffe2d3cb" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247347 1034 "-1" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247347 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247347 1111 #uuid "7c0e1fba-8ed5-51f6-b296-8727a2b28c0f" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247348 1017 #edb/ref 17592186247349 13194139533693 true] [17592186247