d the value of $\\sqrt{3}cot⁡(x-\\pi )-4.$" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247383 1113 #uuid "d4e0627c-7ad9-5c01-b554-599190d7bd8d" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247383 1138 false 13194139533693 true] [17592186247383 1145 "The period of $y=cot⁡x$ is $\\pi .$ Therefore, for integer $n$ we have\n\n$$\ncot⁡x=cot⁡(x+n\\pi ).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=-1$ into the right-hand-side of the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}cot⁡x=cot⁡(x+(-1)\\cdot \\pi )=cot⁡(x-\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $cot⁡x=\\sqrt{3},$ then $cot⁡(x-\\pi )=\\sqrt{3}.$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}cot⁡(x-\\pi )-4 & =\\sqrt{3}(\\sqrt{3})-4 \\\\  & ={(\\sqrt{3})}^{2}-4 \\\\  & =3-4 \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247385 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247386 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247387 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247388 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247389 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1041 "selection" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247388 13194139533693 true] [17592186247384 1110 #uuid "7e0a2ea5-c635-5fb8-970c-d61ad82bd53d" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247385 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247385 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247385 1111 #uuid "b5c18004-772b-59d0-aa2b-8e0bd93c4f9f" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247386 1034 "\\sqrt{3}-4" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247386 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247386 1111 #uuid "55c17395-5e86-56c5-865f-e429419f1770" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247387 1034 "\\pi " 13194139533693 true] [17592186247387 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533693 true] [17592186247387 1111 #uuid "012e802c-a345-53df-8df8-f3db7d16b580" 13194139533693 true] [17592186247388 1034 "-1" 13194139533693 tru